  ],
  "summary": "移动端从底部升起的面板，顶部圆角 + 拖拽把手，提供 40% / 80% 两档高度；点把手或遮罩收起。演示放在窄手机框里，看移动端效果。",
  "usage": "移动端底部弹出的分享、选择、快捷操作面板；需要保留上方页面上下文、又要临时展开操作时用它。",
  "caution": "桌面大屏改用居中弹窗；内容超过 80% 高度改用整页；需要手势下拉时要接真实 touch 事件，别只画一个把手。",
  "hint": "点「分享」升起面板；点把手或遮罩收起；40% / 80% 切换高度",
  "prompt": "【底部面板】目标：移动端商品页点「分享」，一块带圆角的面板从底部升起，遮罩压住页面；面板顶部有拖拽把手，提供 40% / 80% 两档高度，点把手或遮罩收起。\n\n1) 结构：.phone（窄手机框：宽 250、高 min(520px, 100% - 24px)，圆角 24、overflow:hidden）> .screen（页面内容）+ .scrim（absolute inset:0）+ .sheet（absolute left/right/bottom:0，flex 纵向 = .handleWrap 把手 + .sh 标题行 + .sb 内容区）。\n2) 动画：升起 transform translateY(100%) → none，0.34 秒 cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)；高度切换 40% → 80%，0.3 秒同曲线（父高确定时百分比高度可过渡）。遮罩 opacity 0 → 1，0.28 秒，pointer-events none → auto。\n3) 交互：点触发按钮打开；点把手 / 遮罩 / Esc 收起；40% / 80% 两个分段按钮切换高度（.sheet.h80 控制，80% 档额外显示「最近联系人 / 分享到第三方」区块）；把手只做视觉提示，需要真拖拽时接 touch 事件换算高度。\n4) 无障碍：role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby 指向标题；把手 role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"收起面板\"，支持 Enter / 空格；档位按钮 aria-pressed 同步；打开时 focus 到把手（避免移动端键盘弹起），关闭后还给触发按钮。\n5) 坑：面板用 absolute 而不是 fixed，因为要限制在手机框内；手机框 overflow:hidden，否则升起位移会溢出；40% 档内容要精简——卡片预览（400×176）里手机框宽度压到 150、隐藏状态栏和渠道文字，否则 64px 高的面板装不下图标；内容超过 80% 高度就改用整页，不要继续加高。\n6) 配色：只用 --ui-* 变量；面板背景 --ui-surface、把手 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 22%,transparent)、图标底 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 14%,transparent)；主按钮文字用 --ui-bg（深色主题 brand 是白色）。\n7) 自动演示：包在 if(!window.__uiInteractive) 里循环：光标点「分享」→ 面板升到 40% → 点「80%」→ 面板长到 80% → 点手机顶部遮罩（用 cursor.at 算坐标）→ 收起 → 1.6 秒后重来；弹窗里只绑真实交互。\n8) 使用场景：移动端分享 / 选择 / 快捷操作面板；桌面大屏改用居中弹窗，内容超过 80% 高度改用整页。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\nbody{background:radial-gradient(720px 420px at 50% 0%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 10%,transparent),transparent 70%),var(--ui-bg)}\n\n.stage{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:100%;height:100%;padding:8px}\n\n/* ---------- 手机框 ---------- */\n.phone{position:relative;width:250px;height:min(520px,calc(100% - 24px));flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-radius:24px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-bg);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 22px 60px color-mix(in srgb,#000 16%,transparent)}\n.statusbar{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 12px 0;font-size:9px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.statusbar .sig{width:20px;height:6px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 32%,transparent)}\n.screen{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column}\n.top{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 12px 8px}\n.top .back{font-size:14px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);line-height:1}\n.top b{font-size:11px;font-weight:600}\n.top .dots{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);letter-spacing:1px}\n.body{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:2px 12px 10px;overflow:hidden}\n.thumb{flex:0 0 auto;height:74px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 20%,var(--ui-surface)),var(--ui-surface))}\n.pname{font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.pprice{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.spec{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}\n.specRow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:9px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-radius:7px;padding:4px 7px}\n.specRow b{color:var(--ui-text);font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.actbar{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;gap:6px;padding:8px 10px 10px;border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-border) 70%,transparent)}\n.actBtn{flex:1;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;padding:7px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,filter .15s ease}\n.actBtn:hover{filter:brightness(.97)}\n.actBtn.pressing,.actBtn:active{transform:scale(.95)}\n.actBtn.primary{flex:1.4;border-color:transparent;background:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg)}\n\n/* ---------- 遮罩 ---------- */\n.scrim{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:10;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 52%,transparent);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .28s ease}\n.scrim.open{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n\n/* ---------- 底部面板 ---------- */\n.sheet{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:20;height:40%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--ui-surface);border-top:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;box-shadow:0 -12px 36px color-mix(in srgb,#000 12%,transparent);transform:translateY(100%);transition:height .3s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),transform .34s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)}\n.sheet.open{transform:none}\n.sheet.h80{height:80%}\n.handleWrap{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:8px 0 2px;cursor:pointer;outline:none}\n.handle{width:36px;height:4px;border-radius:999px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 22%,transparent);transition:background .15s ease,transform .12s ease}\n.handleWrap:hover .handle{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 34%,transparent)}\n.handleWrap.pressing .handle,.handleWrap:active .handle{transform:scale(.9)}\n.sh{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:2px 14px 10px}\n.sh b{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.seg{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:3px;padding:2px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--ui-surface-2);border:1px solid var(--ui-border)}\n.segBtn{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s ease,color .15s ease,transform .12s ease}\n.segBtn:hover{color:var(--ui-text)}\n.segBtn.on{background:var(--ui-bg);color:var(--ui-text);box-shadow:0 1px 3px color-mix(in srgb,#000 10%,transparent)}\n.segBtn.pressing,.segBtn:active{transform:scale(.94)}\n.sb{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;padding:0 14px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\n/* 滚动条：细窄、无箭头、淡色，悬停加深；只写 webkit 伪元素，Firefox 走 @supports 兜底（同时写 scrollbar-width/color 会让 ::-webkit-scrollbar 整体失效） */\n.sb::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px;height:10px}\n.sb::-webkit-scrollbar-button{display:none;width:0;height:0}\n.sb::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent;margin:6px 0}\n.sb::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 30%,transparent);border:3px solid transparent;border-right-width:4px;background-clip:padding-box;border-radius:999px}\n.sb::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 50%,transparent);background-clip:padding-box}\n.sb::-webkit-scrollbar-corner{background:transparent}\n@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar){\n  .sb{scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--ui-text-dim) transparent}\n}\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}\n.g{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:10px;padding:4px 0;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,background .15s ease}\n.g:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2)}\n.g.pressing,.g:active{transform:scale(.92)}\n.g i{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 14%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text);font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600}\n.g span{color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap}\n.extra{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}\n.sheet.h80 .extra{display:flex}\n.sep{height:1px;margin:6px 0 4px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-border) 80%,transparent)}\n.extra .row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);padding:5px 4px;border-radius:8px}\n.extra .row.head{font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text);padding-top:4px}\n.extra .row .tag{margin-left:auto;font-size:9px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text-dim);border:1px solid var(--ui-border)}\n.extra .ava{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;flex:0 0 auto;background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 26%,var(--ui-surface)),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 9%,var(--ui-surface)))}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .stage{padding:6px}\n  .phone{width:150px;height:calc(100% - 12px);border-radius:16px}\n  .statusbar{display:none}\n  .top{display:none}\n  .body{padding:7px 8px 6px;gap:4px}\n  .thumb{height:34px;border-radius:8px}\n  .pname{font-size:9px}\n  .pprice{font-size:12px}\n  .spec{gap:3px}\n  .specRow{font-size:8px;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:5px}\n  .actbar{padding:6px;gap:5px}\n  .actBtn{font-size:9px;padding:5px 4px;border-radius:7px}\n  .sheet{border-radius:14px 14px 0 0}\n  .handleWrap{padding:5px 0 1px}\n  .handle{width:26px;height:3px}\n  .sh{padding:1px 8px 5px;gap:5px}\n  .sh b{font-size:9px}\n  .seg{padding:1px;gap:2px}\n  .segBtn{font-size:8px;padding:2px 5px}\n  .sb{padding:0 8px 6px;gap:6px}\n  .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:4px}\n  .g{font-size:8px;gap:3px;padding:2px 0;border-radius:6px}\n  .g i{width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:8px;font-size:9px}\n  .g span{display:none}\n  .extra{gap:1px}\n  .sep{margin:3px 0 2px}\n  .extra .row{font-size:8px;padding:3px 2px;gap:5px}\n  .extra .row .tag{font-size:7px;padding:1px 4px}\n  .extra .ava{width:12px;height:12px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .sheet,.scrim,.actBtn,.segBtn,.g,.handle{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"stage\">\n  <div class=\"phone\" id=\"phone\">\n    <div class=\"statusbar\"><span>9:41</span><span class=\"sig\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"screen\">\n      <div class=\"top\"><span class=\"back\">‹</span><b>商品详情</b><span class=\"dots\">⋯</span></div>\n      <div class=\"body\">\n        <div class=\"thumb\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pname\">无线机械键盘 · 青轴</div>\n        <div class=\"pprice\">¥ 268</div>\n        <div class=\"spec\">\n          <div class=\"specRow\"><span>规格</span><b>87 键 / 白色</b></div>\n          <div class=\"specRow\"><span>库存</span><b>有货</b></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"actbar\">\n        <button class=\"actBtn\" type=\"button\">收藏</button>\n        <button class=\"actBtn primary\" id=\"openBtn\" type=\"button\">分享</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"scrim\" id=\"scrim\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"sheet\" id=\"sheet\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"sTitle\">\n      <div class=\"handleWrap\" id=\"handleWrap\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"收起面板\"><i class=\"handle\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"sh\">\n        <b id=\"sTitle\">分享到</b>\n        <div class=\"seg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"面板高度\">\n          <button class=\"segBtn on\" type=\"button\" data-h=\"40\" aria-pressed=\"true\">40%</button>\n          <button class=\"segBtn\" type=\"button\" data-h=\"80\" aria-pressed=\"false\">80%</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"sb\">\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n          <button class=\"g\" type=\"button\"><i>微</i><span>微信</span></button>\n          <button class=\"g\" type=\"button\"><i>圈</i><span>朋友圈</span></button>\n          <button class=\"g\" type=\"button\"><i>链</i><span>复制链接</span></button>\n          <button class=\"g\" type=\"button\"><i>码</i><span>二维码</span></button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"extra\">\n          <div class=\"sep\"></div>\n          <div class=\"row head\"><b>最近联系人</b></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><i class=\"ava\"></i><span>林小满</span><span class=\"tag\">微信</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><i class=\"ava\"></i><span>周启</span><span class=\"tag\">微信</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><i class=\"ava\"></i><span>王浩</span><span class=\"tag\">邮件</span></div>\n          <div class=\"sep\"></div>\n          <div class=\"row head\"><b>分享到第三方</b></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><i class=\"ava\"></i><span>钉钉</span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\"><i class=\"ava\"></i><span>生成分享海报</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var phone = document.getElementById('phone'),\n      sheet = document.getElementById('sheet'),\n      scrim = document.getElementById('scrim'),\n      handleWrap = document.getElementById('handleWrap'),\n      openBtn = document.getElementById('openBtn'),\n      segBtns = sheet.querySelectorAll('.segBtn'),\n      isOpen = false, height = 40, timers = [], cursor = null, cursorReady = false;\n\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i = 0; i < timers.length; i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers = []; }\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursorReady) return cursor;\n    cursorReady = true;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function') cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    return cursor;\n  }\n  function showCursor(){ if(cursor && cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show'); }\n\n  function setH(h){\n    height = h;\n    sheet.classList.toggle('h80', h === 80);\n    for(var i = 0; i < segBtns.length; i++){\n      var on = Number(segBtns[i].getAttribute('data-h')) === h;\n      segBtns[i].classList.toggle('on', on);\n      segBtns[i].setAttribute('aria-pressed', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n    }\n  }\n  function open(){\n    if(isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = true;\n    setH(height);\n    sheet.classList.add('open');\n    scrim.classList.add('open');\n    try { handleWrap.focus({ preventScroll: true }); } catch(e){ /* 老浏览器不支持 preventScroll：宁可不动焦点，也不裸 focus（会把外层页面滚过来） */ }\n  }\n  function close(){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = false;\n    sheet.classList.remove('open');\n    scrim.classList.remove('open');\n    try { openBtn.focus({ preventScroll: true }); } catch(e){ /* 同上：不裸 focus */ }\n  }\n\n  openBtn.addEventListener('click', open);\n  scrim.addEventListener('click', close);\n  handleWrap.addEventListener('click', close);\n  handleWrap.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' '){ e.preventDefault(); close(); }\n  });\n  for(var i = 0; i < segBtns.length; i++){\n    segBtns[i].addEventListener('click', function(e){\n      setH(Number(e.currentTarget.getAttribute('data-h')));\n    });\n  }\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'Escape' && isOpen) close();\n  });\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimers();\n    close();\n    setH(40);\n    if(window.__uiInteractive) return;\n    ensureCursor();\n    if(!cursor){\n      later(open, 450);\n      later(function(){ setH(80); }, 1500);\n      later(close, 2700);\n      later(demoCycle, 3600);\n      return;\n    }\n    showCursor();\n    cursor.moveTo(openBtn);\n    later(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      openBtn.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        openBtn.classList.remove('pressing');\n        open();\n        later(function(){\n          cursor.moveTo(segBtns[1]);\n          later(function(){\n            cursor.press();\n            segBtns[1].classList.add('pressing');\n            later(function(){\n              cursor.release();\n              segBtns[1].classList.remove('pressing');\n              setH(80);\n              later(function(){\n                var pr = phone.getBoundingClientRect();\n                if(cursor.at) cursor.at(pr.left + pr.width / 2, pr.top + Math.max(pr.height * 0.12, 14));\n                later(function(){\n                  cursor.press();\n                  later(function(){\n                    cursor.release();\n                    close();\n                    if(typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide();\n                    later(demoCycle, 1600);\n                  }, 190);\n                }, 520);\n              }, 900);\n            }, 190);\n          }, 520);\n        }, 900);\n      }, 190);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){ /* 弹窗里只绑真实交互 */ }\n  else { setTimeout(demoCycle, 300); }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
